{"id":"n24899-1-12","stage":2,"title":"이리저리 · 到处","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24899-1-12-1","ko":"네 오빠는 또 어딜 간 거니?","zh":"你哥哥又去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"오빠는","meaning":"哥哥（女性对哥哥的称呼）","explanation":"오빠：哥哥（女性对哥哥的称呼）；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오빠","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68006","senseId":"1","lemma":"오빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오빠는","audio":"/audio/9200a4782720b156a129.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"어딜","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어딜","audio":"/audio/f10fe3683e3b73b1fa52.mp3"}},{"text":"간","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3"}},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니","audio":"/audio/3e0100c9477501692d3f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"14e10e3b73bff854","term":"오빠","zh":"哥哥（女性对哥哥的称呼）","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3","entryId":"68006","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["오빠"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/87afe46799491412a35b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24899-1-12-2","ko":"몰라요. 워낙 이리저리 잘 돌아다니잖아요.","zh":"不知道啊。他本来就经常到处乱跑的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몰라요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰라요","audio":"/audio/0d692ebb8eba98e28650.mp3"}},{"text":"워낙","meaning":"本来，根本","explanation":"워낙：本来，根本","readings":[{"term":"워낙","audio":"/audio/290a56095c0643792431.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26711","senseId":"1","lemma":"워낙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"워낙","audio":"/audio/290a56095c0643792431.mp3"}},{"text":"이리저리","meaning":"到处，这儿那儿地","explanation":"이리저리：到处，这儿那儿地","readings":[{"term":"이리저리","audio":"/audio/13c23b5c9bca77153eab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24899","senseId":"1","lemma":"이리저리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이리저리","audio":"/audio/13c23b5c9bca77153eab.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"经常","explanation":"잘：经常","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"9","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아다니잖아요.","meaning":"转悠，跑来跑去","explanation":"돌아다니다：转悠，跑来跑去；잖아요：礼貌地提醒对方已知的事实：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"돌아다니다","audio":"/audio/3dc06ed57f02bb9f3c9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14793","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌아다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아다니잖아요","audio":"/audio/956d16745a44fcfe791d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"290a56095c064379","term":"워낙","zh":"本来，根本","audio":"/audio/290a56095c0643792431.mp3","entryId":"26711","definition":"原来就。","pronunciation":["워낙"]},{"id":"13c23b5c9bca7715","term":"이리저리","zh":"到处，这儿那儿地","audio":"/audio/13c23b5c9bca77153eab.mp3","entryId":"24899","definition":"不确定方向而往这边往那边地。","pronunciation":["이리저리"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"经常","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"习惯性地、常常。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"3dc06ed57f02bb9f","term":"돌아다니다","zh":"转悠，跑来跑去","audio":"/audio/3dc06ed57f02bb9f3c9d.mp3","entryId":"14793","definition":"走遍各处。","pronunciation":["도라다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0274a9294606458dde67.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.402,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24899","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"